\b((let|const|type|)\s+cohere\s+=|(fn|impl|mod|struct|enum|union|trait)\s+cohere)\b Consistency with old learning material: Untaught consolidate Fidelity to the construct's actual behavior: Not at all. Precedent from existing languages: None Brevity / Length: 11 Consistency with related libstd fn conventions: Inconsistent Consistency with the naming of the trait used for ?: Inconsistent Risk of breakage: Very low Used in std: No . Used as crate? No . Usage (sourcegraph): 0+ regex: repogroup:crates case:yes max:400
\b((let|const|type|)\s+consolidate\s+=|(fn|impl|mod|struct|enum|union|trait)\s+consolidate)\b Consistency with old learning material: Untaught unify Fidelity to the construct's actual behavior: Not at all. Precedent from existing languages: None Brevity / Length: 5 Consistency with related libstd fn conventions: Inconsistent Consistency with the naming of the trait used for ?: Inconsistent Risk of breakage: Very low Used in std: No . Used as crate? Yes , no dependencies Usage (sourcegraph): 1 regex: repogroup:crates case:yes max:400
